---A request to annotate one single file, e.g. a PDF, TIFF or GIF file.
---@class gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1AnnotateFileRequest
---@field imageContext? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1ImageContext Additional context that may accompany the image(s) in the file.
