---@field boundingPoly? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1BoundingPoly The bounding polygon for the crop region. The coordinates of the bounding box are in the original image's scale.
---@field confidence? number Confidence of this being a salient region. Range [0, 1].

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1CropHintList gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1CropHint[]

---Set of crop hints that are used to generate new crops when serving images.
---@class gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1CropHintsAnnotation
---@field cropHints? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1CropHintList Crop hint results.

---Parameters for crop hints annotation request.
---@class gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1CropHintsParams
---@field aspectRatios? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.DoubleList Aspect ratios in floats, representing the ratio of the width to the height of the image. For example, if the desired aspect ratio is 4/3, the corresponding float value should be 1.33333. If not specified, the best possible crop is returned. The number of provided aspect ratios is limited to a maximum of 16; any aspect ratios provided after the 16th are ignored.

---Set of dominant colors and their corresponding scores.
---@class gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1DominantColorsAnnotation
---@field colors? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1ColorInfoList RGB color values with their score and pixel fraction.

---Set of detected entity features.
---@class gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1EntityAnnotation
---@field topicality? number The relevancy of the ICA (Image Content Annotation) label to the image. For example, the relevancy of "tower" is likely higher to an image containing the detected "Eiffel Tower" than to an image containing a detected distant towering building, even though the confidence that there is a tower in each image may be the same. Range [0, 1].
---@field locale? string The language code for the locale in which the entity textual `description` is expressed.
---@field confidence? number **Deprecated. Use `score` instead.** The accuracy of the entity detection in an image. For example, for an image in which the "Eiffel Tower" entity is detected, this field represents the confidence that there is a tower in the query image. Range [0, 1].
---@field properties? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1PropertyList Some entities may have optional user-supplied `Property` (name/value) fields, such a score or string that qualifies the entity.
---@field locations? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1LocationInfoList The location information for the detected entity. Multiple `LocationInfo` elements can be present because one location may indicate the location of the scene in the image, and another location may indicate the location of the place where the image was taken. Location information is usually present for landmarks.
---@field mid? string Opaque entity ID. Some IDs may be available in [Google Knowledge Graph Search API](https://developers.google.com/knowledge-graph/).
---@field score? number Overall score of the result. Range [0, 1].
---@field boundingPoly? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1BoundingPoly Image region to which this entity belongs. Not produced for `LABEL_DETECTION` features.
---@field description? string Entity textual description, expressed in its `locale` language.

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1EntityAnnotationList gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1EntityAnnotation[]

---A face annotation object contains the results of face detection.
---@class gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotation
---@field tiltAngle? number Pitch angle, which indicates the upwards/downwards angle that the face is pointing relative to the image's horizontal plane. Range [-180,180].
---@field surpriseLikelihood? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationSurpriseLikelihoodEnum Deprecated: No longer populated.
---@field fdBoundingPoly? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1BoundingPoly The `fd_bounding_poly` bounding polygon is tighter than the `boundingPoly`, and encloses only the skin part of the face. Typically, it is used to eliminate the face from any image analysis that detects the "amount of skin" visible in an image. It is not based on the landmarker results, only on the initial face detection, hence the fd (face detection) prefix.
---@field blurredLikelihood? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationBlurredLikelihoodEnum Blurred likelihood.
---@field landmarkingConfidence? number Face landmarking confidence. Range [0, 1].
---@field angerLikelihood? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationAngerLikelihoodEnum Deprecated: No longer populated.
---@field underExposedLikelihood? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationUnderExposedLikelihoodEnum Under-exposed likelihood.
---@field landmarks? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationLandmarkList Detected face landmarks.
---@field detectionConfidence? number Detection confidence. Range [0, 1].
---@field headwearLikelihood? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationHeadwearLikelihoodEnum Headwear likelihood.
---@field sorrowLikelihood? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationSorrowLikelihoodEnum Deprecated: No longer populated.
---@field rollAngle? number Roll angle, which indicates the amount of clockwise/anti-clockwise rotation of the face relative to the image vertical about the axis perpendicular to the face. Range [-180,180].
---@field boundingPoly? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1BoundingPoly The bounding polygon around the face. The coordinates of the bounding box are in the original image's scale. The bounding box is computed to "frame" the face in accordance with human expectations. It is based on the landmarker results. Note that one or more x and/or y coordinates may not be generated in the `BoundingPoly` (the polygon will be unbounded) if only a partial face appears in the image to be annotated.
---@field panAngle? number Yaw angle, which indicates the leftward/rightward angle that the face is pointing relative to the vertical plane perpendicular to the image. Range [-180,180].
---@field joyLikelihood? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationJoyLikelihoodEnum Deprecated: No longer populated.

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationAngerLikelihoodEnum "UNKNOWN"|"VERY_UNLIKELY"|"UNLIKELY"|"POSSIBLE"|"LIKELY"|"VERY_LIKELY"

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationBlurredLikelihoodEnum "UNKNOWN"|"VERY_UNLIKELY"|"UNLIKELY"|"POSSIBLE"|"LIKELY"|"VERY_LIKELY"

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationHeadwearLikelihoodEnum "UNKNOWN"|"VERY_UNLIKELY"|"UNLIKELY"|"POSSIBLE"|"LIKELY"|"VERY_LIKELY"

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationJoyLikelihoodEnum "UNKNOWN"|"VERY_UNLIKELY"|"UNLIKELY"|"POSSIBLE"|"LIKELY"|"VERY_LIKELY"

---A face-specific landmark (for example, a face feature). Landmark positions may fall outside the bounds of the image if the face is near one or more edges of the image. Therefore it is NOT guaranteed that `0 <= x < width` or `0 <= y < height`.
---@class gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationLandmark
---@field type? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationLandmarkTypeEnum Face landmark type.
---@field position? gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1Position Face landmark position.

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationLandmarkList gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationLandmark[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.vision_v1p2beta1.GoogleCloudVisionV1p2beta1FaceAnnotationLandmarkTypeEnum "UNKNOWN_LANDMARK"|"LEFT_EYE"|"RIGHT_EYE"|"LEFT_OF_LEFT_EYEBROW"|"RIGHT_OF_LEFT_EYEBROW"|"LEFT_OF_RIGHT_EYEBROW"|"RIGHT_OF_RIGHT_EYEBROW"|"MIDPOINT_BETWEEN_EYES"|"NOSE_TIP"|"UPPER_LIP"|"LOWER_LIP"|"MOUTH_LEFT"|"MOUTH_RIGHT"|"MOUTH_CENTER"|"NOSE_BOTTOM_RIGHT"|"NOSE_BOTTOM_LEFT"|"NOSE_BOTTOM_CENTER"|"LEFT_EYE_TOP_BOUNDARY"|"LEFT_EYE_RIGHT_CORNER"|"LEFT_EYE_BOTTOM_BOUNDARY"|"LEFT_EYE_LEFT_CORNER"|"RIGHT_EYE_TOP_BOUNDARY"|"RIGHT_EYE_RIGHT_CORNER"|"RIGHT_EYE_BOTTOM_BOUNDARY"|"RIGHT_EYE_LEFT_CORNER"|"LEFT_EYEBROW_UPPER_MIDPOINT"|"RIGHT_EYEBROW_UPPER_MIDPOINT"|"LEFT_EAR_TRAGION"|"RIGHT_EAR_TRAGION"|"LEFT_EYE_PUPIL"|"RIGHT_EYE_PUPIL"|"FOREHEAD_GLABELLA"|"CHIN_GNATHION"|"CHIN_LEFT_GONION"|"CHIN_RIGHT_GONION"|"LEFT_CHEEK_CENTER"|"RIGHT_CHEEK_CENTER"

